        "en": "You are invited on Saturday 18 October, 6 pm"
      },
      "description": {
        "fr": "Domaine des Cocotiers, Rivière Noire. Dîner debout, tenue décontractée, parking sur place. Merci de répondre avant le 5 octobre.",
        "en": "Domaine des Cocotiers, Rivière Noire. Standing dinner, smart casual, parking on site. Please reply before 5 October."
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "fr": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "required": false,
      "layout_width": "full",
      "validation": {},
      "options": [],
      "rows": []
    },
    {
      "id": "rsvp-f2",
      "type": "single_choice",
      "label": {
        "fr": "Serez-vous des nôtres ?",
        "en": "Will you join us?"
      },
      "description": {
        "fr": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "fr": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "required": true,
      "layout_width": "full",
      "validation": {
        "display_style": "cards"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "rsvp-f2-o1",
          "label": {
            "fr": "Oui, je serai là",
            "en": "Yes, I will be there"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rsvp-f2-o2",
          "label": {
            "fr": "Non, je ne peux pas venir",
            "en": "No, I cannot make it"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rsvp-f2-o3",
          "label": {
            "fr": "Peut-être, je confirme dès que possible",
            "en": "Maybe, I will confirm as soon as I can"
          }
        }
      ],
      "rows": []
    },
    {
      "id": "rsvp-f3",
      "type": "short_text",
      "label": {
        "fr": "Votre nom",
        "en": "Your name"
      },
      "description": {
        "fr": "Tel qu’il figure sur l’invitation, pour que nous vous retrouvions dans la liste.",
        "en": "As it appears on the invitation, so we can find you on the list."
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "fr": "Prénom et nom",
        "en": "First and last name"
      },
      "required": true,
      "layout_width": "full",
      "validation": {},
      "options": [],
      "rows": []
    },
    {
      "id": "rsvp-f4",
      "type": "number",
      "label": {
        "fr": "Combien de personnes vous accompagnent ?",
        "en": "How many guests are coming with you?"
      },
      "description": {
        "fr": "Indiquez 0 si vous venez seul·e. Cinq accompagnants au maximum.",
        "en": "Enter 0 if you are coming alone. Five guests maximum."
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "fr": "0",
        "en": "0"
      },
      "required": false,
      "layout_width": "full",
      "validation": {
        "min": 0,
        "max": 5,
        "response_type": "integer"
      },
      "options": [],
      "rows": []
    },
    {
      "id": "rsvp-f5",
      "type": "long_text",
      "label": {
        "fr": "Des allergies ou un régime particulier dans votre groupe ?",
        "en": "Any allergies or dietary requirements in your group?"
      },
      "description": {
        "fr": "Précisez pour chaque personne concernée, le traiteur s’adaptera.",
        "en": "Mention each person concerned and the caterer will adapt."
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "fr": "Ex. un menu végétarien et une allergie aux fruits de mer.",
        "en": "e.g. one vegetarian menu and one seafood allergy."
      },
      "required": false,
      "layout_width": "full",
      "validation": {
        "max": 400
      },
      "options": [],
      "rows": []
    },
    {
      "id": "rsvp-f6",
      "type": "long_text",
      "label": {
        "fr": "Un mot pour les hôtes ?",
        "en": "A word for the hosts?"
      },
      "description": {
        "fr": "Facultatif, et toujours apprécié.",
        "en": "Optional, and always appreciated."
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "fr": "Votre message",
        "en": "Your message"
      },
      "required": false,
      "layout_width": "full",
      "validation": {
        "max": 500
      },
      "options": [],
      "rows": []
